<title>INDIA: CRICKET-TITAN CUP TRIANGULAR ONE-DAY SERIES STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-TITAN CUP TRIANGULAR ONE-DAY SERIES STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>GUWAHATI, India 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings in the Titan</p>
<p>Cup triangular one-day series after Friday's match (tabulate</p>
<p>under played, won, no result, lost, points):</p>
<p> South Africa   6   6   0   0   12</p>
<p> India	    5   1   1   3    3</p>
<p> Australia	5   0   1   4    1</p>
